See also Zephyr sample: :external+zephyr:zephyr:code-sample:`button`.

   .. zephyr-app-commands::
      :app: zephyr/samples/basic/button
      :build-dir: coffeecaller_nrf52
      :board: coffeecaller_nrf52/nrf52840
      :west-args: -p
      :goals: flash
      :compact:

You should see the following message on the console:

   .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

      .. parsed-literal::

         \*\*\* Booting Zephyr OS build |zephyr_version_em|\ *…*\*\*\*
         Press the button
         Button 5 pressed at 146319
         Button 5 released at 157303
         Button 4 pressed at 200402
         Button 4 released at 210963
         Button 3 pressed at 242262
         Button 3 released at 250714
         Button 2 pressed at 296248
         Button 2 released at 305933
         Button … … …
